            <ArticleTitle>Anticoagulant therapy and subdural hematoma formation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>30-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Subdural hematoma formation should be considered as a diagnosis in the patient who complains of headache and is on long-term anticoagulant therapy. Three such cases are described and the proper medical management is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
